    "description_raw": "This spell functions like brand, except that it inflicts 1d6 points of damage when applied and cannot be removed, even temporarily. In addition, a greater brand blazes as bright as a torch when brought within 30 feet of a visible symbol of your faith. While the symbol is blazing, the recipient is sickened.\n\nLike the effects of bestow curse, a greater brand cannot be dispelled, but it can be removed by any means that removes a mark of justice.",
